      "value": "My 2 worlds are also put back into Community Labs.\n\nCase1 \nI updated my public world on May 18th ,then the world forced to be into Labs.\nAbout 2 month ago, in this case, the world remains public. I remember.\nBugs or specifications ? \nTagged　\"System Labs\"\n\nWorld ID : wrld_ac3207cd-8dbe-4148-9b3b-b92bdcd65f73\nSDK Version : 2019.03.07.12.19\n\n\nCase2\nI do NOTHING. But today I found that my public world forced to be into Labs.\n\nWorld ID\nwrld_c580a8c0-0516-4152-8f4e-8de75fbdfc08\nSDK Version : 2019.03.07.12.19\n\nIn both case, I cannot push Publish button.\n\nNewer SDK users seem to be in troubled more serious situation.\nPlease fix it as soon as possible.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
